#: admin/adminpannel.php
msgid "The real address of private lesson videos and files is never sent to the browser; each user gets their own signed link (valid for 12 hours). If someone else opens the link, they see \"You are not logged in\" or \"This link does not belong to you\". Aparat/YouTube videos and HLS/DASH streams are not covered by this option."
