msgid "The page where you placed the shortcode [nias_certificate_verify]. Once selected, the QR code of new certificates points to the verification form (QR links of old certificates keep working). If left empty, the certificate display page is used, and if that is not set either, the plugin's built-in verification page (/?nias_verify=code); so certificate QR codes never lead to an error page."
